<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="und">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>en-emphasis-strike</title>
  <style>
body {
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.6;
  max-width: 48rem;
  margin: 2rem auto;
  padding: 0 1rem;
  color: #1a1a1a;
  background: #fff;
}
pre, code {
  font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
}
pre {
  padding: 1rem;
  background: #f4f4f4;
  overflow-x: auto;
  border-radius: 4px;
}
table {
  border-collapse: collapse;
  width: 100%;
  margin: 1rem 0;
}
th, td {
  border: 1px solid #ddd;
  padding: 0.5rem;
  text-align: left;
}
th {
  background: #f8f8f8;
}
blockquote {
  border-left: 4px solid #ddd;
  margin: 1rem 0;
  padding-left: 1rem;
  color: #555;
}
img {
  max-width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>A Reminder</h1>
<p><em>Record</em> the bridge before the route <strong>turns east</strong>. <del>Ignore the old water mark</del>; it still helps.</p>
</body>
</html>
